					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-460519#post-2108233</guid>
				<title>The smileybot is still gone.</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-460519/conclusions-re:d-173-2263-incident#post-2108233</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 12 Sep 2014 09:57:33 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Adam Smascher</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>587467</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Thank you. That was the meta-intent, here. I kept bitching that 173 made no sense as presented in-article, but no one's gonna change it, so I wrote this to hang a lampshade on it instead: a character of my writing bitching to the character of someone I frequently bitched to about it, wondering how nobody wondered about it before. Dude's a bro.</p> <p>And what do you know? People like that a lot more than bitching, so shades on.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
